    on~a~one-time~hook~that~has~already~been~used.~
    You~have~to~add~the~code~before~the~hook~is~used,~
    or~add~the~code~without~arguments~using~\iow_char:N\\#2~instead.\\
    \\
    LaTeX~will~use~\iow_char:N\\#2.
