    LaTeX~has~been~asked~to~create~a~new~floating~point~identifier~'#1'~
    but~this~name~has~already~been~used~elsewhere.
  }
\msg_new:nnnn { fp } { id-undefined }
  { Floating~point~identifier~'#1'~is~undefined. }
